        "image_label": "Lifestyle: changing days",
        "wide": true,
        "reverse": false,
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "",
        "text": "<p>Your days change. Your surroundings change. Your skin experiences it all.</p><p>Heat, humidity, pollution, air conditioning, travel and changing seasons all shape how skin feels from one day to the next.</p><p>EMBRAE was created to make everyday skincare feel simpler, more thoughtful and easier to live with.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": ""
